# Melvin · name aliases

- **Fracttal** = **Fractal** (same competitor). Prefer spelling **Fracttal** in UI; when the ata/Gemini says "Fractal", treat it as Fracttal.
- **Tractian** = **"Traction"** in the ata Gemini summary (00:46:38). Prefer spelling **Tractian** in UI; Igor listed it as both software and hardware competitor.
- **TEBE** = **"TEB"** in the ata. Prefer **TEBE Sensores** (tebesensores.com) for hardware/IoT battlecards.
- **BBX** appears in the ata hardware list (00:46:38). Public match used in the Book: **BBX Visible** (bbxvisible.com). The ata names only “BBX”, not the URL.
- **Curso** rows in GIM (ABRAMAN, Engeteles, Modular…): competitors of **Manutenção em Ação**, not Melvin CMMS software.
